  "title": "使用 Claude Platform 降低成本并提升性能",
  "segments": {
    "b001": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "性能与成本常常被视为一种权衡：想少花钱，就得接受更差的结果。但在实践中，我们发现许多使用 Claude Platform 的应用可以通过三项改进在不牺牲性能的前提下削减成本：最大化提示缓存命中率、在升级到前沿 Claude 模型时移除提示中的反模式，以及根据任务校准投入的思考量。我们已将这些指导整理进 "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/claude-api"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "inline_code",
              "text": "claude-api "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "skill"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。在本文中，我们将展示 Claude Code 搭配 "
        },
        {
          "type": "inline_code",
          "text": "claude-api "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "往往能够找到在保持甚至提升性能的同时降低成本的方法。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b002": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "提示词缓存"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "b003": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "在 Claude 生成回复之前，它会先将你的提示词处理成一个内部工作状态。这一步称为"
        },
        {
          "type": "emphasis",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "预填充"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "，是处理输入过程中开销最大的部分。提示词缓存会保存该状态（即键值缓存，KV cache）：当某个请求以相同的前缀开头时，Claude 会将其读回，而不是重新计算。缓存读取的"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "计费价格仅为"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "完整输入价格的一小部分。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b004": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "要有效利用提示缓存，有几点实际的注意事项。首先，提示缓存与特定模型绑定。其次，提示缓存的读取必须在整个提示的完整范围内做到"
        },
        {
          "type": "emphasis",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "逐字节精确一致"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。最后，提示缓存的"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching#ttl-support"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "存活时间有限"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "（TTL）。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b005": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "考虑到这几点，这里有一些实用的建议："
        }
      ]
    },
    "b006": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "避免在对话中途更改 effort 或 thinking 设置"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。这些设置会在你的内容之前被渲染进提示词中，因此它们属于被缓存的前缀部分。特别是在使用 Claude Opus 5 和 Fable 5.1 时，你可以"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/effort#changing-effort-mid-conversation"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "在对话中途更新 effort"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "而不会破坏缓存。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b008": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "不要把易变的值放在前缀中"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。系统提示词中的动态时间戳或 ID 会在不同的模型调用之间发生变化，从而破坏缓存。 "
        }
      ]
    },
    "b010": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "避免会自行重新排序的工具定义"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。使用 Claude Messages API 时，"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching#structuring-your-prompt"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "提示词的组装"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "顺序是固定的，工具定义会被渲染在最前面。对工具定义的任何改动都会导致缓存失效。 "
        }
      ]
    },
    "b012": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "分叉对话时要小心"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。只有当分叉的前缀在字节层面完全一致、使用同一模型、且采用相同的 effort 设置时，子代理和分支才会共享父级的缓存。 "
        }
      ]
    },
    "b014": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "避免使用超出缓存 TTL 的同步工具调用和子智能体"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。如果一个智能体阻塞在长时间运行的工具调用或子智能体上，缓存可能在结果返回之前就已过期。下一轮就必须重写缓存，费用是正常输入价格的 1.25 倍（1 小时缓存则为 2 倍），而不是便宜的读取价格。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b016": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "如何修复"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b017": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "我们"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://claude.com/blog/lessons-from-building-claude-code-prompt-caching-is-everything"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "积累"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "了一些关于提示词缓存管理的经验教训： "
        }
      ]
    },
    "b018": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "仔细监控你的提示缓存命中率"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/cache-diagnostics"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Claude Console"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 提供提示缓存诊断功能，包括提示缓存未命中的原因（图 1）。如果命中率意外下降，"
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/cache-diagnostics"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "缓存诊断 API "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "会准确告诉你两个请求在哪里出现了分歧。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "b021": {
      "status": "translated",
      "inlines": [
        {
          "type": "strong",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "推迟加载不常用的工具"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "。预先声明你所有的工具，但把不常用的那些标记为 "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "attrs": {
            "url": "https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/tool-use-with-prompt-caching#defer-loading-and-cache-preservation"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "defer_loading"
